OL,3,GNEWSADriver banned from road after
OL,4,A130mph police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been banned from driving for
OL,7,F18 months after travelling at more than
OL,8,F130mph during a police pursuit.
OL,10,FMason Sapsford-Howard was driving a red
OL,11,FFord Fiesta on the A11 near Thetford,
OL,12,FNorfolk, in March, when officers saw
OL,13,Fhim "dangerously" force his way past a
OL,14,Fcoach on a roundabout and a police
OL,15,Fpursuit ensued.
OL,17,FThe 20-year-old of Bunwell Road,
OL,18,FAttleborough, pleaded guilty for
OL,19,Ffailing to stop and indicated guilty
OL,20,Ffor driving a motor vehicle
OL,21,Fdangerously.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
