OL,3,GNEWSADriver banned from road after
OL,4,A130mph police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Norwich Magistrates' Court on
OL,7,FWednesday he was disqualified from
OL,8,Fdriving for 18 months, ordered to pay
OL,9,F#429 and told to complete a
OL,10,Frehabilitation activity requirement and
OL,11,F250 hours of unpaid work.
